*title=Text("Consumer Rights and Grievance Process","નh1")
*section1=Card(title="Evidence to Keep Evidence",children=[Column(Text("Save order confirmation, invoice/bill, product listing screenshots and payment proof.","h3")))
*section2=Card(title="First Complaint: Seller and Platform",children=[Column(Row(children=[Text("Report the defect immediately in writing through the app, email, or seller, and clearly ask for refund, replacement, or repair.","sm"),Divider","If the marketplace route fails, escalate to platform’s grievance officer/nodal contact and include order number, defect evidence and the exact remedy sought.","grievance officer/nodal contact","","","","","Under current consumer guidance, platform-side redressal should be triggered quickly; some guidance cites a7-hour response expectation for defective goods but this should be treated as a platform-facing service timeline rather than a guaranteed statutory remedy window.","7-hour"))
